</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bddd2032-0bde-11ea-9862-005056bff430/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bddd2032-0bde-11ea-9862-005056bff430/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">548f2600-787b-11f1-8316-c97e3808f541</guid><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 14:21:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>瑞迪</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻解说</category><title>IEA报告解析：中国为何能仅以法国或美国一半的成本建造核电站</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%B4/20260705-iea%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E8%83%BD%E4%BB%85%E4%BB%A5%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E6%88%96%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E6%A0%B8%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%99</link><description>
